ments are somewhat absurd to get and without them your repertoire of equips is lacking.", "timestamp_created": 1516044215, "timestamp_updated": 1516044215, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "39371692", "author": {"steamid": "76561198117322731", "personaname": "ZikkityZakOTA", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ZikkityZakOTA/", "num_games_owned": 947, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 2760, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2490, "last_played": 1555908266, "avatar": "c1708ac29a50b388b8258bdba157dcd20a416009"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a really good game, but why not add all of the achievements? Too lazy? I don't blame the devs. I feel like this game needs a little more work though. Also, I can't wait for ROR 2.", "timestamp_created": 1516041799, "timestamp_updated": 1516041799, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "39342527", "author": {"steamid": "76561197998343607", "personaname": "Vivian", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Hisstress/", "num_games_owned": 551, "num_reviews": 187, "playtime_forever": 5831, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5725, "last_played": 1474845982, "avatar": "c800c25effe2f4c0b1f7f5530ebd73b944c191c4"}, "language": "english", "review": "➕ Amazing soundtrack\n➕ Heavy replayability\n➕ 11 unique characters with their own ending\n\nThere's nothing really negative that I